    <relatedEntity>Contact</relatedEntity>
    <templateVersions>
        <content>Create a warm, personalized email to the customer using the following inputs:
- {!$Input:Contact.Name}: Greet them.
- Cart Products: Mention the items they left in their cart.
- Discount Offer: Inform about a special offer to complete the purchase.
- Purchase Link: Provide a direct link to complete their checkout.

Keep the email short (under 200 words), action-driven, and friendly. Mention urgency subtly (e.g., &quot;Don&apos;t miss out!&quot;). Close with a warm message.

</content>
